bluejetty:00156821:ios.description:
ASIFlex Self Service mobile application allows you as an ASIFlex participant to sign in to your account.
The mobile application is designed to allow you to file a new claim or complete unfinished claim(s). You can attach documentation to your claim simply by taking a picture with your smartphone or tablet or choosing an existing picture from your gallery.
You can also view information regarding your account(s) including:
・ Your annual election amount(s);
・ The remaining balance in your account(s);
・ Payments from and contributions to your account(s);
・ Previously submitted claims;
・ Unfinished claims; and
・ Other activity on your account.

